<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A1.SS4" title="In Appendix A An Generative Agent Active Shooter Incident Interactive Social Simulation Environment ‣ Implicit Behavioral Alignment of Language Agents in High-Stakes Crowd Simulations" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">A.4 </span>Agent Personas</span></a></li>
