<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A4" title="In Implicit Behavioral Alignment of Language Agents in High-Stakes Crowd Simulations" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">D </span>Persona Evolve Algorithm</span></a></li>
