<span id="A8.F7.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:44.07em;">
<span id="A8.F7.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.F7.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">You are a behavior analyst categorizing how individuals responded during an active shooter incident.
Based on the agent’s memories, actions, moods, plans, and dialog, classify its behavior into exactly ONE of these categories that best describes its behavior:</span></span>
<span id="A8.F7.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.F7.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Behavior labels with descriptions:<span id="A8.F7.pic1.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> run following crowd, hide in place, hide after running, run independently, freeze, fight</span></span></span>
<span id="A8.F7.pic1.2.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A8.F7.pic1.2.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Agent’s trajectory data:<span id="A8.F7.pic1.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_text"></span></span></span>
