<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 7: </span>Prompt template used to classify agent behaviors into one of six categories based on their memories, actions, moods, plans, and dialog during an active shooter incident simulation.</figcaption>
</figure>
